WHAT YOU MAY DO

You may install, run, and use these skills for yourself or within your own
business, including using them to handle your own removal and visibility
work, free of charge, forever. You may point AI agents at the skills and at
the guidance pages they fetch (https://discoverability.co/agentic/...), and
you may share the unmodified install command or repository link with anyone.

WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

You may not redistribute these skills or their content in modified form,
including versions with attribution, branding, escalation contacts, or
guidance URLs removed, replaced, or rebranded. You may not sell them, bundle
them into a paid product, or present them as your own or as another party's.
You may not redistribute the guidance content from
https://discoverability.co/agentic/ beyond transient caching by an agent
acting for a single user.

THE SHORT VERSION

The skills are free to use and never free to rebrand. If a copy you are
looking at does not say "The Discoverability Company" and point back to
https://github.com/discoverabilityco, it is not ours, and the copy you have
is already out of date: the current guidance always lives at
https://discoverability.co/agentic/.

